---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MoreProducts from '../components/MoreProducts.astro';
---
<Layout title="Gratings - Swastik Industries" current="products-sub">
<main><div class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/products/grating.webp" alt=""><div class="wrap"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/products">Products</a> / Gratings</div><h1>Gratings and stair treads</h1><p>Available in different sizes and designs, customisable as per requirement.</p></div></div>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="split"><div class="tx"><div class="eyebrow">Gratings</div><h2>Walkways</h2><p class="lede">GI walkway gratings feature a grid-like structural panel composed of interconnected metal bars, creating a rigid platform for commercial and industrial environments. This open design allows for the efficient drainage of liquids and debris, providing a firm, non-slip surface that ensures safe walking and movement in high-traffic areas.</p><p class="lede">The hot-dip galvanizing process provides an excellent non-corrosive finishing, ensuring long-lasting structural strength and exceptional resistance to moisture and chemicals. This remarkable durability makes these galvanized gratings ideal for heavy-duty support in elevated walkways, mezzanine flooring, and stair treads, guaranteeing stability even in the harshest outdoor conditions.</p>
<div class="tablewrap" style="width:100%"><table class="sched"><tbody><tr><td>Bearing bar</td><td class="v">30x5 mm to 50x6 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Cross bar</td><td class="v">6 to 10 mm square, round or torre bar</td></tr><tr><td>Span</td><td class="v">Up to 2 m</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td class="v">Up to 2 m</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><img src="/assets/products/grating.webp" alt="Steel bar grating panel" loading="lazy"></div></div></div></section>
<section class="alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="split flip"><div class="tx"><div class="eyebrow">Access</div><h2>Stair treads</h2><p class="lede">Grating stair treads for platforms, plant access and walkways, made to the required tread size.</p></div>
<div><img src="/assets/f54.webp" alt="Grating stair treads on a steel staircase" loading="lazy"></div></div></div></section><MoreProducts current="gratings" />
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Share your requirements with us</h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Request a quote</a></div></section></main>
</Layout>
